 "Selamat datang di Miaw Tracker": "Welcome to Miaw Tracker",
 "Tracker ini menyatukan kebiasaan, tugas, target, catatan, dokumen, dan keuanganmu dalam satu tempat.": "This tracker brings your habits, tasks, goals, notes, documents, and finances together in one place.",
 "Semua data tersimpan di perangkatmu dan disinkronkan ke akun sendiri.": "All data is stored on your device and synced to your own account.",
 "Tutorial ini ±1 menit — kamu bisa melewatinya kapan saja.": "This tutorial takes about 1 minute — you can skip it anytime.",
 "1. Isi Kebiasaan (Habit)": "1. Fill In Your Habits",
 "Habit adalah pondasi. Isi daftar kebiasaanmu, lalu centang kotaknya setiap kali selesai.": "Habits are the foundation. Add your habit list, then tick the box each time you finish one.",
 "Ada tiga jadwal: harian, mingguan, dan bulanan (pilih saat menambah kebiasaan).": "There are three schedules: daily, weekly, and monthly (pick one when adding a habit).",
 "Klik slot kotak untuk mencentang — nilai poin tersimpan otomatis.": "Click a slot to tick it — points are saved automatically.",
 "Streak dan skor bulanan dihitung dari centang ini.": "Streaks and monthly scores are calculated from these ticks.",
 "2. Catat Task & Agenda Harian": "2. Log Tasks & Daily Agenda",
 "Di Daily Task kamu menulis kegiatan hari ini, sedangkan Jadwal untuk agenda bertanggal.": "In Daily Task you write today's activities, while Schedule holds your dated agenda.",
 "Tambah kegiatan, pilih jenis (rutin/sekali) dan jamnya.": "Add an activity, choose its type (routine/one-time) and its time.",
 "Prioritas memberi warna: tinggi, sedang, rendah.": "Priority adds a colour: high, medium, low.",
 "Buka detail task untuk memakai sesi fokus (timer).": "Open the task detail to start a focus session (timer).",
 "3. Tentukan Goals & Project": "3. Set Goals & Projects",
 "Goals adalah hasil besar yang ingin dicapai. Pecah menjadi Project, lalu Project Task yang bisa dicentang.": "Goals are the big outcomes you want to reach. Break them into Projects, then into Project Tasks you can tick off.",
 "Buat goal: tulis judul, kategori, dan deadline-nya.": "Create a goal: write its title, category, and deadline.",
 "Tambahkan milestone untuk memantau kemajuan.": "Add milestones to track progress.",
 "Project mewadahi task, catatan, dan berkasnya.": "A project holds its tasks, notes, and files.",
 "4. Simpan Catatan & Dokumen": "4. Keep Notes & Documents",
 "Catatan untuk ide dan jurnal (autosave), Dokumen untuk berkas dan tautan penting.": "Notes for ideas and journaling (autosave), Documents for important files and links.",
